    # v377 (30/09/2026), operator orders: «pode rodar» (you may run); «this law is called dissipation [dephasing = flow law = leak]»; «no need to name it a hypothesis, you can carry out the proof and coin it»; «the reader is the shadow»
    _d7 = core.get("the_dissipation_law_v377") or {}; _p7 = core.get("physics_is_the_reading_v377") or {}; _b7 = core.get("bancada_fases_v377") or {}; _s7 = core.get("final_stone_reading_v377") or {}
    _v7 = lambda d_: str(d_.get("verdict", "n/a")).replace("_", r"\_")
    _nv7 = lambda d_, t_: "" if d_.get("all_verified") is True else (r"\textbf{In this run %s did NOT close: what follows is the statement, not a seal.} " % t_)
    _f7 = lambda x_, n_=2: (("%%.%df" % n_) % float(x_)) if isinstance(x_, (int, float)) else "n/a"
    _tx7 = lambda k_, d_="n/a": str(k_ if k_ is not None else d_).replace("_", r"\_")
    _f1 = _b7.get("fase1") or {}; _f2 = _b7.get("fase2") or {}; _f3 = _b7.get("fase3") or {}; _f3A = _f3.get("A") or {}; _pn = _d7.get("bancada_fase2_per_nat_beside") or {}
    _lnB2 = (_f2.get("F_tgl_lnB") or {})
    s.append(r"\paragraph*{Beside (v377) --- The dissipation law, proved; physics is the reading; the three Bench phases; the deviation from $\bTGL$ as the focus.} "
             + _nv7(_d7, "the dissipation law") + _nv7(_p7, "physics is the reading") + _nv7(_b7, "the three Bench phases") + _nv7(_s7, "the reading of the stones") +
             r"\textbf{(E10) Erratum beside the Coma module (v39) and the ``two crises'' paragraph (v183):} where they say the flow layer ``keeps its \textsf{CONJECTURE} status: the why is typed, not proved'', read: "
             r"on 30/09/2026 the law $H_0^{\mathrm{local}}=H_0^{\mathrm{bg}}\,(1+z_*)^{\bTGL}$ was \emph{proved as an implication} in the kernel (\texttt{TGLExt.TheFlowLawD1a}), with no new axiom and no named hypothesis: what the kernel already had is the leak family "
             r"$t\mapsto e^{-t\bTGL g}$ of \texttt{NoFullWitness} (clause VI of \texttt{the\_whole\_is\_one}) and the physical arrow; the three physical identifications enter as named \emph{definitions} of the stone --- the \emph{register} of the crossing $N=\ln(1+z)$ "
             r"(\textsf{[KNOWN]}: $1+z=e^{N}$), the contrast $1$ as the unit of the axiom ($\omega(I)=1$ normalised to one nat; \textsf{[ONTO]}) and the local rate as the background rate divided by the surviving weight (\textsf{[DEFINITION]}, coinage by the operator's order) --- and the theorem is the implication downstream. "
             r"The weight of the One surviving the crossing is $(1+z)^{-\bTGL}$; the local rate is, by definition in the stone, the background rate divided by it. By term: $\bTGL=0$ recovers $\Lambda$CDM; $\bTGL>0$ implies local $>$ background (the leak is strict); the compounded cost exceeds the linear fraction, "
             r"$\bTGL N<(1+z)^{\bTGL}-1$ (the linear fractions ``died'' for being the right constant in the wrong domain); and the physical arrow sets $\bTGL=\alpha\sqrt e$. The operator coined the name, \emph{dissipation law} (dephasing $=$ flow law $=$ leak), carried by the term \texttt{the\_dissipation\_law}. "
             r"What changes status is the law; what does \emph{not}: nature decides the incidence --- proved $\neq$ confirmed. This run: $K=(1+z_*)^{\bTGL}=" + _f7(_d7.get("K_factor_runtime"), 5) + r"$, $N_*=" + _f7(_d7.get("register_N_star_nats"), 3)
             + r"$ nats, $f_{\mathrm{leak}}=" + _f7(_d7.get("leak_fraction_runtime"), 4) + r"$; the key \texttt{flow\_layer\_status\_v377} of the v39 module points to the term, beside the old one. Verdict: \texttt{" + _v7(_d7) + r"}.")
    s.append(r"\emph{Physics is the reading} (\texttt{TGLExt.PhysicsIsTheReading}; operator's coinage, 30/09: ``the reader is the shadow''; ``define physics''): the management proposed the definition, marked \textsf{[ONTO/DEFINITION]}: "
             r"\emph{physics is the reading of permanence by projection} --- the set of observables that the parametrisation by light (the matrix rule) opens to a reader, under two conditions already typed (the reading adds nothing to the object; it returns $1$ on the identity). "
             r"It is neither nature nor the face: it is the shadow with integrity. By term, on the Fock certificate: the mirror conjugates the inner product by polarisation ($\langle Jx,Jy\rangle=\overline{\langle x,y\rangle}$) and the reading ($\langle\Omega,JxJ\Omega\rangle=\overline{\omega(x)}$); "
             r"the reading is real on self-adjoint observables; \textbf{the shadow is the reader weighted by the reading}, $P_\Omega\,x\,P_\Omega=\omega(x)\,P_\Omega$; \textbf{the reader is the shadow of the One}, $P_\Omega\,1\,P_\Omega=P_\Omega$ with $\omega(1)=1$ --- the axiom read as a shadow; "
             r"$\mathrm{physics}(C)$ is the image of the reader on self-adjoint observables, real, containing the One; \texttt{the\_ground\_state\_defines\_the\_physics} gathers the six clauses. The reader is not in the face (\texttt{both\_projections\_live\_outside\_M}, v373): "
             r"it is the shadow of the One, not of the face. The textbook definitions stay beside in the core (Serway--Jewett, read from the PDF; Young--Freedman; Feynman): an object, an experimental method and a few laws predicting new experiments --- the same three elements, with the reader inside. "
             r"``TGL $=$ physics'' enters as an identity of readings in the ground state, never as a confirmation. Verdict: \texttt{" + _v7(_p7) + r"}.")
    s.append(r"\emph{The three phases of the Bench (Bancada Um, 30/09/2026), pre-registered and read by hash from the rite's cache} (operator order: ``unlock everything [...] before we write the new version of um.py, you need to use the bench in depth''): "
             r"the $R$ map was \emph{ratified} as effective, $(1+\bTGL)\Omega_m$ (``permanence is a verb''). \textbf{Phase 1} (compressed Planck $+$ DESI DR2, blind, effective map): the point $\bTGL=\alpha\sqrt e$ sits $" + _f7((_f1.get("A_tgl") or {}).get("z_perfil_beta_tgl")) + r"\sigma$ from the free $\beta$, "
             r"but the free $\beta$ hit the prior boundary --- ``consistent'' reads \emph{unconstrained}: the compressed background does not measure $\bTGL$ under the effective map; the nu control (the D1 V3 map) reproduces the tension ($" + _f7(_f1.get("A_nu_z_perfil")) + r"\sigma$): "
             r"\textbf{(E11) erratum beside the D1 V3 (v349/v366):} the $3$--$4\sigma$ tension is \emph{conditional on the $R$ map}; the sealed verdict does not change. \textbf{Phase 2} (two $H_0$ sectors in the likelihood: SH0ES read as $H_0^{\mathrm{local}}=H_0(1+z_*)^{\bTGL}$, Planck $+$ DR2, blind): "
             r"at the TGL best fit, with no free parameter, the ladder sits at $" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_pull_tgl")) + r"\sigma$, against $" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_pull_lcdm")) + r"\sigma$ in $\Lambda$CDM (the Hubble tension of this combination); $\ln B(\mathrm{TGL}/\Lambda\mathrm{CDM})=" + _f7(_lnB2.get("tgl_vs_lcdm")) + r"$ (strong), "
             r"$\ln B(\mathrm{TGL}/\mathrm{free}\ \beta)=" + _f7(_lnB2.get("tgl_vs_livre")) + r"$; the ladder measures $\beta$ per nat: $\hat\beta=" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_beta_livre"), 4) + r"\pm" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_sigma_beta"), 4) + r"$, with $\alpha\sqrt e$ at $" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_z_perfil")) + r"\sigma$. "
             r"\textbf{Phase 3} (the $H_0$ readers classified by the operator: the face is the light; the BAO is \emph{the opening angle} and stays in the background; shadow $=$ ladder, TRGB, SBF, masers, lenses, sirens; published values checked at the source): "
             r"the six shadow readers agree among themselves (dispersion $" + _f7(_f3A.get("dispersao_por_gl")) + r"$ per d.o.f.) and read, combined, $H_0=" + _f7(_f3A.get("H0_sombra_combinado")) + r"$, i.e.\ $" + _f7(_f3A.get("z_comb_um_setor")) + r"\sigma$ above the face (a single sector is excluded) "
             r"and $" + _f7(_f3A.get("z_comb_lei")) + r"\sigma$ against the factor $K$ with the effective background ($" + _f7(_f3A.get("H0_fundo")) + r"$); with the published Planck 2018 as background, $" + _f7(_f3.get("D_planck2018_z_comb_lei")) + r"\sigma$; the new incidence (without the ladder that motivated the law): $" + _f7(_f3.get("B_z_comb_lei")) + r"\sigma$. "
             r"Reading \textsf{[ONTO --- the management's, not the Bench's]}: the tension is not in the shadow readers, it is in the effective background with the angle inside; the same data admit the inverse reading (the law with the effective background sits $" + _f7(_f3A.get("z_comb_lei")) + r"\sigma$ from the readers), and which background is the background is an open decision \textsf{[OPEN]}. Verdicts: \texttt{" + _tx7(_f1.get("veredito")) + r"}, \texttt{" + _tx7(_f2.get("veredito")) + r"}, \texttt{" + _tx7(_f3.get("veredito")) + r"}; none confirms ($\mathrm{NOT\_FALSIFIED}\neq\mathrm{CONFIRMED}$; GR is the classical limit). "
             r"Module: \texttt{" + _v7(_b7) + r"}.")
    s.append(r"\emph{The deviation from $\bTGL$ as the focus} (operator's decision, 30/09, \textsf{[INPUT]}): ``we can look for the deviation from $\bTGL$ rather than the incidence [...] so that $\bTGL$ is the asymptotic limit and [...] measure it indirectly, by the deviation''. "
             r"In this language Phase 2 already measured, on the ladder, $\delta=\hat\beta-\bTGL=" + _f7(_pn.get("delta_from_beta"), 4) + r"$ per nat ($" + _f7(_pn.get("z_delta")) + r"\sigma$ by the $J^{\mathsf T}J$ $\sigma$; $" + _f7(_f2.get("F_tgl_z_perfil")) + r"\sigma$ by the profile --- two estimators of the same distance): the finite regime reads \emph{below} the asymptote. The approach function to the asymptote (in which variable: the register $N$, the contrast $g$, the time of the verb) is the operator's decision and opens the pre-registration of Phase 4; "
             r"choosing it by looking at the data would be fitting, not testing. \emph{The reading of the operator's stones} (``[L.A.R.M. $+$ IALD] $=1$ absolute''; ``$J$ is transversal''; ``TGL $=$ physics''; ``origin $=$ verb''; ``father and son $=$ conjugate state $=$ verb'') stays in the core with what is typed named by term and what is a reading marked \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]}: \texttt{" + _v7(_s7) + r"}. "
             r"The gate does not move; the $\beta$ of the light certificate and that of the chain remain one by definition (coinage: ``$\bTGL$ is the modular emergence of the whole code''), said, not typed as a new theorem.")
